1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:46,840
They were such a loving couple,
and now they're suddenly getting divorced?

4
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,480
There wasn't even a hint of trouble.

5
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:51,280
They should never have married.

6
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:54,480
Her birth mother is immoral and despised.

7
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:57,080
She grew up with no proper guidance,

8
00:01:57,160 --> 00:02:00,440
so she's headstrong,
arrogant, and reckless.

9
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,920
She's unfit to be
a member of the Lu family.

10
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:07,280
Mother! Help, Mother!

11
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:09,199
- What happened?
- Mother!

12
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,560
- Slow down.
- Slow down.

13
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,480
- Oh my!
- My goodness!

14
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,920
Wanniang, what are you doing?

15
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,240
Please find a way
to keep Wei Rao here, whatever it takes.

16
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:21,200
The night she married into our family,

17
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:24,080
Lu Zhuo woke up.

18
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,840
And today, as soon as
she said she was leaving,

19
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:30,360
he started coughing up blood again!

20
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:33,360
Heaven has bound their fates together.

21
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:36,440
If they part, disaster is sure to follow!

22
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:39,000
If they really divorce,

23
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:43,600
Lu Zhuo may not survive!

24
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:48,240
Mother, I'm begging you!

25
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:52,280
You must find a way
to stop Wei Rao from leaving!

26
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,120
Have you no dignity, sobbing like this?

27
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:57,280
- Get up.
- Wanniang.

28
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,280
- Please get up.
- Get up.

29
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,920
Wanniang, get up first.

30
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:07,200
Mother, let me try
to persuade Wei Rao first.

31
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,240
- Then we can decide what to do.
- Go.

32
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,640
Your qi is blocked by grief
and inflamed by sudden rage.

33
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,920
You must calm your mind…

34
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,560
My Lord, you mustn't get up.

35
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:21,280
My Lord, you mustn't move!

36
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,240
Don't touch me.

37
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:26,800
My Lord, whatever the matter is,
it must wait until you've recovered.

38
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,000
- I want to see Wei Rao.
- My Lord!

39
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,160
- Out of my way!
- My Lord!

40
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,400
Quick, help him.

41
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,320
Rao,

42
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,360
you were lost young, left to the streets.

43
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,880
Life would have
had you miss this marriage.

44
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:41,240
Yet, through a twist of fate,
you found the way back to him.

45
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:44,800
This bond was forged by Heaven.
No one can break it.

46
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,440
Why are you so determined to sever it?

47
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:50,760
Has the Lu family mistreated you,
or has Lu Zhuo hurt you?

48
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,800
The Lu family and
His Lordship have treated me well.

49
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:04,480
Lu Zhuo has saved me
from danger many times.

50
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:07,800
He even defied imperial decrees
and deceived His Majesty.

51
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,400
The Duke accused him of grave defiance,

52
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:13,400
neglecting his duties, and
violating family rules, all because of me.

53
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,279
It's precisely because he's so good to me

54
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,600
that I must divorce him.

55
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:23,240
You want a divorce
because he's good to you?

56
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,560
Rao, what you're saying
makes no sense to me.

57
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,760
I simply can't understand it.

58
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:30,640
<i>I've always been alone</i>
<i>and know nothing of love.</i>

59
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,960
<i>I cannot return his deep affection.</i>

60
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:37,800
<i>By leaving, I can spare him a wasted life.</i>

61
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:41,440
I was once
an orphan with no one to turn to.

62
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,880
I relied on
His Lordship's protection to stay safe.

63
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,160
Now I've reclaimed
my place in my birth family.

64
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,760
I have a fief and troops of my own.

65
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,840
With my birth mother's power behind me,

66
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,960
I can live as happily as I please.

67
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:02,400
Why stay here and suffer everyone's scorn?

68
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,400
Being Lu Zhuo's wife

69
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,960
is like living under
a roof that forces me to stoop.

70
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:15,880
I must obey every rule
and be a virtuous wife.

71
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:19,840
Every day I stay here
is another day without joy.

72
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,640
Please let me go.

73
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:29,120
Do you truly feel nothing for Lu Zhuo?

74
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,160
Nothing.

75
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,320
You should leave.

76
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,080
Since you've made your decision,

77
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:14,040
have a carriage prepared
to escort the Noble Lady away.

78
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,920
- My Lord…
- Go!

79
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,240
Lu Zhuo.

80
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:29,800
Rao.

81
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:34,120
Why pretend to care?

82
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:36,240
Lu Zhuo, calm down.

83
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:38,120
Mother will never agree to this.

84
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,560
I've made my decision.

85
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,360
Thank you.

86
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:45,080
I'm the one who should thank you,

87
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,360
Noble Lady Wu'an.

88
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,800
Thank you for being honest

89
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,760
and letting me see who you really are.

90
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,080
Don't think too highly of yourself.

91
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,560
I can live without you.

92
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:04,200
This marriage is a mistake.

93
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,400
The sooner we end it, the better.

94
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,240
You're magnanimous
and understanding, My Lord.

95
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,120
That puts my mind at ease.

96
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,640
I won't see you off, Your Ladyship.

97
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,600
You may go.

98
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,320
Fine. One of you is heartless,
and the other is too proud

99
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,760
to speak honestly.

100
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,240
I shouldn't have interfered.
I shouldn't have come at all.

101
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,960
Thank you for granting my wish.

102
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,000
Keep packing.

103
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:48,880
SONGYUE HALL

104
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:59,520
My Lady, everything is packed.

105
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,040
Why are there two
more chests than we counted?

106
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:13,280
- Everything is here.
- Okay.

107
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,560
Be careful.

108
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,360
Understood.

109
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,480
- Remember to take this.
- All right.

110
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,600
When Grandmother
asked to expedite our wedding,…

111
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:27,320
she promised the Wei family
that if you ever left the Lu family,

112
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,080
we would give you extra gold as a dowry.

113
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,000
I'm honoring that promise.

114
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:38,120
I'm a lucky beast <i>Pixiu</i> reborn.

115
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,600
I love money more than anything.

116
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,559
If you're willing to offer,
I'll gladly take it.

117
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:45,480
Think of yourself
as a partner in my estate.

118
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:48,040
When the harvest comes,
you'll get a fifth.

119
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,000
No need.

120
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,120
If you leave, no need to see me again.

121
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,880
I'll have someone deliver it.

122
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:01,920
Stop, all of you!
No one is to move anything!

123
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,400
Rao,

124
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:07,160
what has made you unhappy
here in the Lu family?

125
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,480
Why are you so determined to divorce?

126
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,760
Unless you give me a proper explanation,

127
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,040
I won't let you leave.

128
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:14,080
Mother, don't make this difficult for her.

129
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,680
His Majesty has issued the decree.

130
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,560
I don't care.

131
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:22,000
My husband died in battle.

132
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:25,880
You, my son, are the one person in my life
that has kept me going.

133
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:30,200
If anything happens to you,
I won't go on living!

134
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:33,720
If the imperial family wants to punish me,
let them come and cut off my head!

135
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:37,280
Rao, is something troubling you?

136
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:40,480
You can tell me.
I'll see that you're treated fairly.

137
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,400
Grandmother, Mother,

138
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:47,360
- in fact, I…
- Rao,

139
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,120
I'm begging you.

140
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:51,320
Please stay.

141
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,640
Enough, Mother!

142
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:56,040
The men of the Lu family,
in every generation,

143
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,760
are fated to die only in battle.

144
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:03,160
My life was spared on the battlefield.

145
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:05,760
That means my time has not yet come.

146
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,040
The idea that this marriage
saved me is absurd.

147
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,960
Never mention it again.

148
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,960
Besides, Wei Rao isn't
the one seeking a divorce.

149
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:18,800
I am.

150
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:21,640
You… Why would you do this?

151
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:26,080
I used to mistake Wei Rao for Jundai.

152
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:29,040
I believed her to be cruel and vicious,

153
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,480
so I despised her and kept testing her.

154
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,760
To this day,…

155
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,240
we have never consummated our marriage.

156
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,360
You…

157
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:44,560
For a bride,
what could be more humiliating?

158
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:46,920
Lu Zhuo, you're usually so sensible.

159
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:50,320
How could you make
such an outrageous mistake?

160
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,920
Though Wei Rao is
of the Wei family's blood,

161
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,760
she was abandoned as a child

162
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,440
and did menial work to survive.

163
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,640
All noble ladies of the capital

164
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,520
are excel at music,
<i>weiqi,</i> calligraphy, and painting.

165
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:05,400
They're virtuous, well-spoken, graceful,
and skilled in the domestic arts.

166
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:09,480
She alone has none of these qualities.

167
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,520
How could a woman
with so little virtue or talent

168
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,600
be fit to be my wife?

169
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,800
You…!

170
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:19,720
- Mother!
- You foolish boy!

171
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:22,520
How can you look down
on your own wife like this?

172
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,800
Mother, don't blame him.

173
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,360
It's not your place to speak!

174
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:27,680
We are

175
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:30,440
not right for each other.

176
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:35,320
To free ourselves, we have to divorce.

177
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:36,600
You…!

178
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:38,000
I'm the one
determined to leave the Lu family.

179
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,960
It's not his fault.

180
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,240
Enough!

181
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:44,600
What's done is done. We can't stop them.

182
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,320
Let them be!

183
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,160
How…

184
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:54,400
How can you be so foolish?

185
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,840
You've shown me such kindness and care.

186
00:11:58,920 --> 00:11:59,880
I'll never forget it.

187
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,680
Please take care of yourselves.

188
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,120
I bid you farewell.

189
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,120
Rao…

190
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:23,320
SONGYUE HALL

191
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,840
You let her go today.

192
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:30,800
I hope you won't regret it later.

193
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,040
She chose to leave me.

194
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:40,040
What is there to regret?

195
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:53,400
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

196
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:56,000
<i>If Heaven truly answers prayers,</i>

197
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:59,560
<i>I, Wei Rao,</i>
<i>willingly give up this marriage</i>

198
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,080
<i>and vow never to marry again.</i>

199
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:04,080
<i>In return, please let him</i>
<i>soon find a beautiful wife</i>

200
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:08,800
<i>who will cherish him,</i>
<i>respect him, and treat him well.</i>

201
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:13,640
His Lordship ordered me to
escort Your Ladyship out of the city.

202
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:16,480
Are you going to Mount Yaowang?

203
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:17,400
No.

204
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:21,000
- I'd like to visit somewhere first.
- Understood.

205
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:33,720
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

206
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,520
You needn't follow me.

207
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:50,720
MY COUSIN JUNDAI

208
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:57,480
I never expected this.

209
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:00,800
You're the only one
who's come to visit her.

210
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,080
Haven't you come too?

211
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:07,160
Her birth mother, Wei,
has been exiled far away.

212
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,840
Her birth father's
whereabouts are unknown.

213
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:11,440
Fearing Lady Li's power,

214
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:14,320
the Earl of Cheng'an's household
dared not prepare her for burial.

215
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:18,680
So it fell to me, an outsider,

216
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:23,640
to take care of her remains
and lay her to rest.

217
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:28,480
But Wei Rao, why have you come?

218
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,800
Of all people in this world,

219
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:33,400
you should hate Jundai the most.

220
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,680
Before Jundai died,

221
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,400
she said something to me.

222
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,480
What did she say?

223
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:52,560
My life was never my own.

224
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:55,680
Neither is my death.

225
00:15:57,440 --> 00:16:00,000
Those who loved me abandoned me.

226
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,000
Those I love…

227
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:08,200
No one's ever taught me what love is.

228
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:12,000
I spent my whole life
striving for fame and status,

229
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:15,080
struggling with all I had.

230
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,560
And what did I gain?

231
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:23,640
I'm left with nothing.

232
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,560
Wei Rao…

233
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:43,720
"I lived in splendor, clothed in silk."

234
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:46,640
"Yet in death, I'll lie in
a lonely grave outside the city."

235
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:49,520
"Who brought me into this world?"

236
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,920
"Who has ever truly loved me?"

237
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:56,400
If someone has gone through life
without ever being treated kindly,…

238
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,520
how can she understand love?

239
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:04,240
How can she even feel she has
the right to love anyone else?

240
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:06,800
HERE LIES MY COUSIN JUNDAI

241
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,200
I cared for her,

242
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,760
yet I left her too.

243
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:16,880
Perhaps you're right. I let her down.

244
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,079
You did nothing wrong.

245
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:24,200
It is only that in your heart,
many things outweighs her.

246
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:27,400
Your family. Your honor.

247
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:35,160
If Jundai hurt you,
please don't hold it against her.

248
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:39,680
She was someone to be pitied too.

249
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,640
Lady Shou'an has been waiting
at the estate for some time.

250
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:13,920
Grandmother is here?

251
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,280
Nice work.

252
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,320
- You're too kind.
- You've been working on it for so long.

253
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,840
You're welcome.

254
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,560
Back to work.

255
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,640
Be careful.

256
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,560
Grandmother.

257
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:37,040
Rao, I couldn't trust
anyone else to handle this,

258
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,520
so I brought them here myself.

259
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:43,800
Let me help you.

260
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:48,520
I beg your forgiveness, Your Ladyship.

261
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:53,040
I put you through so much.
I deserve to die a thousand deaths.

262
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:55,600
I would accept being cut to pieces.

263
00:18:56,840 --> 00:18:59,640
But please spare my two children.

264
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,880
They knew nothing of it.

265
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:10,360
Quick, kneel and kowtow to
Her Ladyship. Beg for her forgiveness!

266
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,480
Please get up.

267
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:15,200
You're my elder.
Don't shorten my life by kneeling to me.

268
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,160
Hongxian, Runsheng, get up.

269
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:23,360
If you hadn't found me on that mountain,

270
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:26,040
I would have frozen
to death that winter night.

271
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:27,800
I wouldn't be here
enjoying all this today.

272
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:31,880
I don't blame you.

273
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:35,120
I told you she was very forgiving.
Never hold a grudge against us.

274
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:38,080
Raising her means more than giving birth.
It was you who raised her.

275
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,840
For that alone,

276
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,920
she should repay
our family a thousand times over.

277
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,000
What nonsense are you spouting?

278
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,960
Who do you think you are
to demand anything from her?

279
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:48,840
Your Ladyship, are we still family?

280
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:52,240
Can I still see you as my sister?

281
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:16,120
Runsheng is right.

282
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:18,200
Mother took me in.

283
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:19,960
I'll remember
that kindness for as long as I live.

284
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:23,280
Go prepare food and wine.

285
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,320
Yes! Bring me plenty of good wine.

286
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:29,440
And send them up the mountain
to hunt more wild ducks and pheasants!

287
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:32,480
- Runsheng!
- Go on!

288
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:41,160
Mother, it's windy out here.
Let's go inside.

289
00:20:42,320 --> 00:20:43,520
Come, Grandmother.

290
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:48,440
- Don't worry about it. I am used to it.
- That's nice.

291
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,280
It's Bitao.

292
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:05,480
Tell me.

293
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:09,560
What arrangements will you make
for Qiao and her family?

294
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,480
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

295
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:13,920
With all the building work at the estate,
this is no place for Ma to recover.

296
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,440
I plan to go to her hometown, Shuzhou,

297
00:21:16,520 --> 00:21:19,400
and find a quiet little courtyard house
in a lively neighborhood.

298
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:22,600
Then Ma can move there
with Hongxian and Runsheng.

299
00:21:23,120 --> 00:21:25,640
Runsheng is lazy and undisciplined.

300
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:26,960
I'll find him an apprenticeship.

301
00:21:27,560 --> 00:21:29,960
Hongxian is bright.

302
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:32,400
I'll find her
a virtuous, accomplished female tutor

303
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:33,800
to give her a proper education.

304
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:36,160
I'll have them sent there tonight.

305
00:21:37,320 --> 00:21:40,520
Shuzhou, with its lovely hills and rivers,

306
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:45,040
is certainly
a fine place for recuperation.

307
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:49,520
For someone her age,
returning to her hometown is a comfort.

308
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:53,200
I'm sure
your adoptive mother will be content.

309
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:54,640
Yes.

310
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:59,840
Compassion is a form of wisdom.

311
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,400
Qiao is selfish.

312
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:04,920
Even so, she saved your life.

313
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:07,600
You must treat her well
and let everyone see

314
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:10,400
your kindness and compassion,

315
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:12,960
so they'll know
you're worthy of their loyalty.

316
00:22:13,560 --> 00:22:14,760
This is something

317
00:22:14,840 --> 00:22:17,880
your birth mother doesn't understand.

318
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:21,080
In that respect,
you're better than she is.

319
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:24,320
But you've made a serious mistake.

320
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:27,120
Please enlighten me, Grandmother.

321
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:29,880
You shouldn't have divorced Lu Zhuo.

322
00:22:32,520 --> 00:22:36,560
The Lu family's heir
had the ability and family standing

323
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,720
to be a worthy match for you.

324
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:41,560
Above all, he cared for you

325
00:22:41,640 --> 00:22:43,640
and could give you the strongest support.

326
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,400
With your intelligence,

327
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:49,320
you should have kept him
firmly in the palm of your hand.

328
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:51,680
He could offer you protection.

329
00:22:51,760 --> 00:22:53,360
Why did you let him get away?

330
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:57,480
I didn't let him get away. I set him free.

331
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:05,760
Well,

332
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:09,040
your mother is far more ruthless than you.

333
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:12,520
To her, men are merely
precious gems in her phoenix crown

334
00:23:12,600 --> 00:23:14,720
or the sharpest swords in her hand.

335
00:23:15,320 --> 00:23:16,520
But Rao,…

336
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:22,880
letting him go
will bring you a great deal of trouble.

337
00:23:23,760 --> 00:23:25,200
What trouble?

338
00:23:25,280 --> 00:23:27,040
Those caught in a storm

339
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:30,680
often fail to see
the danger right before them.

340
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:35,560
Your mother sees it,
yet she still lets you have your way.

341
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:39,040
Possessing a treasure can
make an innocent man a target.

342
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:44,360
It won't be long
before you understand that.

343
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:52,840
Runsheng!

344
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:53,920
ZHUYU ESTATE

345
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,360
Let go of him!

346
00:23:55,960 --> 00:23:57,080
- Hit him!
- Runsheng…

347
00:23:58,080 --> 00:24:00,240
- It's all mine!
- Runsheng!

348
00:24:00,840 --> 00:24:03,680
- More wine! I want more!
- Runsheng!

349
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:10,760
Hongxian, when you reach Shuzhou,
someone will help you settle in.

350
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:13,560
Take good care of Ma.

351
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:23,840
You've cared for us for so many years.
I'll never forget it as long as I live.

352
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:28,440
From now on, I'll care for Mother myself
and keep Runsheng in line.

353
00:24:31,000 --> 00:24:32,280
Take care of yourself, Rao.

354
00:24:43,440 --> 00:24:44,280
Go on.

355
00:25:16,480 --> 00:25:17,400
Wei Rao,…

356
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:22,840
you're no longer A-Chou.

357
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:39,040
GENTLE AS A SOFT BREEZE

358
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:39,960
Zhuo!

359
00:25:40,480 --> 00:25:41,680
- Zhuo!
- General Qi.

360
00:25:41,760 --> 00:25:43,080
His Lordship is ill.

361
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:45,800
- Move aside. It's urgent.
- General Qi, His Lordship…

362
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:48,960
I hear you've divorced the Noble Lady?

363
00:25:49,840 --> 00:25:51,360
You knew already?

364
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:53,440
His Majesty issued the decree himself,
granting the divorce.

365
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:56,320
Noble Lady Wu'an's dowry
was carried out of the Duke's Residence.

366
00:25:56,400 --> 00:25:58,280
In less than an hour,
the news had spread everywhere.

367
00:25:59,320 --> 00:26:01,680
Who in the capital doesn't know?

368
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,800
Is that all you came to ask?

369
00:26:05,720 --> 00:26:08,000
Zhuo, are you really letting her go?

370
00:26:10,320 --> 00:26:11,680
What does that have to do with you?

371
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:20,400
"A fair lady is
a gentleman's ideal match."

372
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:25,040
My friend, if I marry Noble Lady Wu'an,

373
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,360
will you turn against me?

374
00:26:28,040 --> 00:26:30,200
Do you only know
that one line from "Guan Ju"?

375
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:33,320
What about the saying,

376
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:37,680
"A friend's wife is off limits"?

377
00:26:42,360 --> 00:26:45,080
Ever since we were children,
I've never competed with you for anything.

378
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:49,440
But this time, I can't step aside for you.

379
00:26:50,080 --> 00:26:51,640
There's only one Wei Rao in this world.

380
00:26:52,240 --> 00:26:54,000
Plenty of noble ladies in the capital.

381
00:26:54,920 --> 00:26:56,200
Why have you set your heart on her?

382
00:26:57,760 --> 00:27:00,920
Actually, I knew
very early on she was an imposter.

383
00:27:02,360 --> 00:27:03,720
But I didn't care.

384
00:27:03,800 --> 00:27:08,160
Her beauty doesn't come
from her looks or her birth.

385
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:11,960
All she has to do is stand there,
and she lights up everything around her.

386
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:16,080
That day, I watched from the city gate
tower as she tore up the land deeds.

387
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:18,200
HENGCHENG GATE

388
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:23,880
<i>It suddenly struck me that</i>
<i>I'd never meet another woman</i>

389
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:25,800
<i>who could compare to Wei Rao.</i>

390
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:29,520
Fine.

391
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:31,600
Go court your fair lady, then!

392
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,000
I won't stand in your way.

393
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:39,640
Who are you to stop me?
You're the one who's been cast aside.

394
00:27:44,280 --> 00:27:47,280
To tell you the truth,
if I had a wife like her,

395
00:27:47,360 --> 00:27:50,760
I'd stay by her side every day
and never give another man a chance.

396
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:54,840
Now that you've let her go,
even if I didn't pursue her,

397
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:58,400
men would still flock to her in droves
because of her title.

398
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,200
If you don't believe me,
just wait and see.

399
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:02,000
I told you it's none of my concern.

400
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:05,280
You really don't mind?

401
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:07,080
I'm tired.

402
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:09,800
Get out, will you?

403
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:13,640
All right, all right. I won't bother you.

404
00:28:14,160 --> 00:28:16,920
Now that I have your answer,

405
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:20,000
- I can rest easy!
- Show him out!

406
00:28:24,880 --> 00:28:26,040
Zhuo.

407
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:30,680
Rest well, and don't worry!

408
00:28:39,080 --> 00:28:41,040
My Lord, your medicine.

409
00:28:41,120 --> 00:28:41,960
No need.

410
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:49,120
My Lord,

411
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:51,200
some larger items
from the Noble Lady's dowry

412
00:28:51,280 --> 00:28:52,520
were left behind
because they're hard to move.

413
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:55,880
Her Grace ordered me
to deliver them to Zhuyu Estate.

414
00:28:57,360 --> 00:29:00,280
- Zhuyu?
- The Noble Lady chose the name herself.

415
00:29:01,520 --> 00:29:04,520
In the legends, Zhuyu is a wild herb
that grows on Mount Zhaoyao

416
00:29:04,600 --> 00:29:06,160
and keeps hunger at bay.

417
00:29:08,360 --> 00:29:09,800
She certainly isn't picky.

418
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:14,080
- Help me up.
- My Lord, where are you going now?

419
00:29:21,120 --> 00:29:22,080
Zhuyu Estate.

420
00:29:22,160 --> 00:29:24,920
ZHUYU ESTATE

421
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:27,760
I found this while
reclaiming land in the mountains.

422
00:29:28,360 --> 00:29:29,720
It looks like wheat.

423
00:29:30,320 --> 00:29:32,680
Wheat berries aren't that small.
It's clearly a wild grass.

424
00:29:32,760 --> 00:29:34,960
It's called brome,
also known as cheat grass.

425
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:37,560
People often eat it during famines.

426
00:29:38,160 --> 00:29:39,640
Try grinding it into flour.

427
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:41,560
Have you eaten it too, Your Ladyship?

428
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:43,440
Don't be foolish.
Her Ladyship would never eat this.

429
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:45,920
- She's simply very knowledgeable.
- Yes, of course.

430
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:48,160
The notice says that anyone who finds

431
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:50,280
food plants or medicinal herbs
in the mountains will be rewarded.

432
00:29:50,360 --> 00:29:51,200
Is that true?

433
00:29:51,280 --> 00:29:52,880
- Keep it safe.
- All right.

434
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:54,080
Gejin.

435
00:29:57,960 --> 00:30:00,120
Your Ladyship is so kindhearted.
Heaven will bless you.

436
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,960
Don't let the brome seeds
fall into the wheat fields.

437
00:30:03,040 --> 00:30:04,240
They'll ruin the crop.

438
00:30:04,320 --> 00:30:05,160
- Yes.
- Yes.

439
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:10,240
Here she comes. That's her.

440
00:30:10,320 --> 00:30:11,520
The girl with the scar on her face.

441
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:13,720
She barely says a word all day.

442
00:30:13,800 --> 00:30:15,440
She always takes
the hardest, most tiring work

443
00:30:15,520 --> 00:30:17,320
and works even harder than the men.

444
00:30:17,400 --> 00:30:18,520
What a strange girl.

445
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:21,560
That's a lot of firewood.

446
00:30:30,560 --> 00:30:32,360
I'm heading home to cook.

447
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:36,000
Your Ladyship,
Lord Han requests to see you.

448
00:30:36,080 --> 00:30:37,200
Lord Han?

449
00:30:41,600 --> 00:30:44,280
I, Han Liao, come bearing rods to
beg Noble Lady Wu'an's forgiveness.

450
00:30:45,080 --> 00:30:46,600
I had a funeral to arrange,

451
00:30:46,680 --> 00:30:48,120
so I was late in taking up
my duties as your servant.

452
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:50,920
I've come to offer my apology.

453
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:52,600
I wouldn't dare accept.

454
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:58,880
His Majesty gave a verbal decree
ordering me to serve you

455
00:30:58,960 --> 00:31:01,240
for one month. I dare not disobey.

456
00:31:01,320 --> 00:31:03,280
If you put our past
behind us and take me in,

457
00:31:03,360 --> 00:31:04,680
it would be an act of great generosity.

458
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:12,040
If you command it, I'll brave any danger.

459
00:31:14,600 --> 00:31:15,440
Look over there.

460
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:19,360
My maid carries
80 jin of firewood every day,

461
00:31:20,040 --> 00:31:21,920
yet you've brought only
a few rods to beg forgiveness.

462
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:25,560
You clearly aren't sincere.
What use would you be to me?

463
00:31:26,960 --> 00:31:31,160
You think too highly of yourself, Han!
Her Ladyship can't stand the sight of you.

464
00:31:31,240 --> 00:31:32,680
Get out of here!

465
00:31:32,760 --> 00:31:36,000
Wei Rao, he has a glib tongue
and sinister intentions.

466
00:31:36,080 --> 00:31:37,880
Don't let him fool you.

467
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:41,000
The moment you heard
she'd left the Duke's Residence,

468
00:31:41,080 --> 00:31:43,280
you couldn't wait to come running.

469
00:31:43,360 --> 00:31:47,280
If we're talking about ulterior motives,
you're no better than I am, General Qi.

470
00:31:47,880 --> 00:31:49,920
Lord Lu and I have never gotten along.

471
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:51,320
It's only natural for me to come here.

472
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:54,160
But you and Lu Zhuo
are the closest of friends.

473
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:56,120
To come here and win her favor,

474
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:57,800
do you have no shame?

475
00:31:58,520 --> 00:32:01,480
If I weren't here,
how could I keep scoundrels like you away?

476
00:32:02,360 --> 00:32:05,000
You're a weasel in human form,
always looking for a gap.

477
00:32:05,600 --> 00:32:07,000
As if they deserve a thing.

478
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:11,200
Bring it over! Let Her Ladyship see!

479
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:16,640
What's this for?

480
00:32:17,240 --> 00:32:18,560
Didn't Your Ladyship
want to learn horse riding?

481
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:20,720
I pick a fine horse from
the Western Regions for you.

482
00:32:20,800 --> 00:32:22,800
It crosses mountains
as easily as flat ground.

483
00:32:22,880 --> 00:32:24,560
A thousand li a day is nothing to it.

484
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:26,240
Come. I have some free time today.

485
00:32:26,320 --> 00:32:27,560
I'll teach you to ride.

486
00:32:30,040 --> 00:32:30,880
You may go.

487
00:32:33,600 --> 00:32:34,800
- I'd like to try.
- Sure.

488
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,640
Han Liao, are you
deliberately causing trouble?

489
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:40,960
I volunteer to lead your horse
and hold your stirrup, Your Ladyship.

490
00:32:43,040 --> 00:32:46,240
Lord Han, you'd stoop this low?

491
00:32:46,320 --> 00:32:48,560
Aren't you afraid of being laughed at?

492
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:52,320
You're crude and lack
common sense, General Qi.

493
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:55,440
Beginners can easily
fall and injure themselves.

494
00:32:55,520 --> 00:32:59,000
With me by her side,
Her Ladyship's safety is assured.

495
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:03,000
Stop making trouble.

496
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,840
Your Ladyship, Lord Lu is here.

497
00:33:29,640 --> 00:33:30,720
Lord Han.

498
00:33:31,800 --> 00:33:35,040
This horse may be gentle,
but it's rather tall.

499
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:38,200
I need a mounting block.

500
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:46,840
Use me as your mounting block,

501
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:49,080
and you'll settle into
the saddle more securely.

502
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:50,000
Your Ladyship, please.

503
00:33:50,600 --> 00:33:53,440
Such shameless groveling.
Have you no dignity?

504
00:33:54,200 --> 00:33:56,760
Such bitter jealousy. How petty you are.

505
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,240
Bend over.

506
00:34:18,159 --> 00:34:20,760
Is this human mounting block
to your liking, Your Ladyship?

507
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:24,239
You'll do as a lowly groom.

508
00:34:25,760 --> 00:34:27,199
When it comes to riding and archery,

509
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:29,760
I won't claim to be the best in the world,

510
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:31,080
but I'm more than
qualified to teach Your Ladyship.

511
00:34:31,159 --> 00:34:32,679
If you wish, I can…

512
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:36,040
I didn't ask you anything.
You're a mere groom.

513
00:34:36,120 --> 00:34:37,199
How dare you speak out of turn?

514
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:39,960
Wei Rao, let me teach you instead.

515
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:43,280
Let's go.

516
00:34:45,760 --> 00:34:47,960
You'd even fight over being her groom.

517
00:34:48,040 --> 00:34:49,920
- Have you no dignity?
- Get lost!

518
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:53,040
I'm happy to do it. Better than being
a groveling, mangy dog like you.

519
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:54,320
- Let go.
- You let go.

520
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:57,680
- It's my horse.
- I don't care!

521
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:59,520
- Let go!
- Let go!

522
00:34:59,600 --> 00:35:00,640
Let go now!

523
00:35:00,720 --> 00:35:01,920
You let go!

524
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:03,760
- Doesn't your leg hurt?
- Let go!

525
00:35:03,840 --> 00:35:05,360
You have no shame!

526
00:35:05,440 --> 00:35:07,000
And you do?

527
00:35:09,640 --> 00:35:12,160
My Lord, shall I help you…?

528
00:35:12,760 --> 00:35:13,680
Back to the residence.

529
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:15,280
My Lord, you came
all this way despite being ill.

530
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:18,000
You haven't even spoken to Her Ladyship,
and you're leaving already?

531
00:35:20,280 --> 00:35:21,200
She's having too much fun…

532
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,720
- Let go!
- …to spare me a glance.

533
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:24,440
- Let go!
- Go away!

534
00:35:24,520 --> 00:35:26,120
Why stay and be a nuisance?

535
00:35:26,200 --> 00:35:27,320
It's my horse! Get lost!

536
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:28,360
Get moving!

537
00:35:29,280 --> 00:35:30,200
Go!

538
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:31,440
You're such a scoundrel!

539
00:35:31,520 --> 00:35:32,360
- I'll lead it.
- Let go!

540
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,200
Give it to me!

541
00:35:35,160 --> 00:35:36,240
Will you let go already?

542
00:35:38,640 --> 00:35:39,680
You just won't stop!

543
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:40,600
Stop.

544
00:35:46,880 --> 00:35:47,720
You needn't follow me.

545
00:35:50,320 --> 00:35:51,440
That goes for you too.

546
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:59,720
Qi Zhongkai,
don't get too pleased with yourself.

547
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:04,160
Noble Lady Wu'an may not get
to decide whom she marries for herself.

548
00:36:05,160 --> 00:36:08,960
Who will take this thorny rose home

549
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:11,240
remains to be seen.

550
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:13,480
Don't even dream of it!

551
00:36:13,560 --> 00:36:15,280
Whoever she chooses, it won't be you.

552
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:17,920
You can wait till
you go blind, you groveling dog,

553
00:36:18,520 --> 00:36:19,640
and you'll still never have her.

554
00:36:24,240 --> 00:36:25,840
Keep your eyes open

555
00:36:27,600 --> 00:36:28,800
and wait and see.

556
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:30,760
Let's go!

557
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:37,440
Your Ladyship,

558
00:36:37,520 --> 00:36:39,080
The estate is currently
building grounds and garden plots.

559
00:36:39,160 --> 00:36:43,000
To renovate the buildings,
we're using salvaged bricks and tiles.

560
00:36:43,080 --> 00:36:45,320
The cost is low.
It's mostly a matter of labor.

561
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:48,000
And that is exactly
what we have plenty of.

562
00:36:48,520 --> 00:36:50,520
In my humble opinion,
the large courtyard on the west side

563
00:36:50,600 --> 00:36:52,080
can be turned into a brewery.

564
00:36:52,160 --> 00:36:54,200
The northern section can be used
to raise silkworms and spin yarn.

565
00:36:54,280 --> 00:36:56,920
That way,
we'll earn considerably more next year.

566
00:36:58,560 --> 00:36:59,680
Your Ladyship!

567
00:37:00,320 --> 00:37:01,600
Your Ladyship.

568
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:02,520
AS THE SUN RISES

569
00:37:02,600 --> 00:37:04,520
There are so many people outside!

570
00:37:04,600 --> 00:37:05,440
Please come and see!

571
00:37:06,440 --> 00:37:07,400
<i>Your Ladyship!</i>

572
00:37:07,480 --> 00:37:09,040
We want to see Her Ladyship!

573
00:37:09,120 --> 00:37:10,040
Let us in!

574
00:37:10,120 --> 00:37:11,960
We want to see Her Ladyship!

575
00:37:12,040 --> 00:37:14,440
- We request an audience with Her Ladyship!
- Let us in!

576
00:37:14,520 --> 00:37:16,960
- She's not receiving visitors today.
- Let us see her!

577
00:37:17,040 --> 00:37:18,240
Please leave, everyone!

578
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:20,240
Close the gates!

579
00:37:20,880 --> 00:37:22,080
- Hurry!
- Just let us see her!

580
00:37:22,160 --> 00:37:23,960
There are so many people.
It'll be terrible if trouble breaks out.

581
00:37:24,040 --> 00:37:25,120
What do we do?

582
00:37:25,200 --> 00:37:27,720
- Your Ladyship!
- Your Ladyship!

583
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,720
CAISHU HALL

584
00:37:30,440 --> 00:37:32,200
- Who are those people outside?
- Your Ladyship.

585
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,240
Those people are…

586
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:37,040
They're poor people who own land
in nearby prefectures and counties.

587
00:37:37,120 --> 00:37:38,400
They've come to seek
Your Ladyship's protection.

588
00:37:39,080 --> 00:37:39,960
It's common for
jobless drifters with no land

589
00:37:40,040 --> 00:37:41,360
to come and seek my protection.

590
00:37:42,440 --> 00:37:45,120
Why would people who own land come?

591
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:47,720
Your Ladyship, His Majesty
understands the people's hardships,

592
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:49,640
so he's graciously offered state farmland

593
00:37:49,720 --> 00:37:50,840
for displaced people
to rent and cultivate.

594
00:37:51,600 --> 00:37:53,240
He's exempted them
from taxes for the first five years

595
00:37:53,320 --> 00:37:56,600
and lent them seeds and farm tools
free of charge. Unfortunately…

596
00:37:56,680 --> 00:37:58,960
Unfortunately,
the powerful nobles are too greedy.

597
00:37:59,560 --> 00:38:01,360
They often bribe land
officials to seize the land.

598
00:38:02,160 --> 00:38:05,320
They take 80 percent of the harvest
from the poor people's fields,

599
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:07,920
yet they pay the state very little tax,
or none at all.

600
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:10,200
When these people heard that you

601
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:13,160
reduced rents and treated tenants well,

602
00:38:13,240 --> 00:38:15,200
they rushed to offer you their land,

603
00:38:15,920 --> 00:38:19,000
hoping to keep the harvest
they've worked for all year.

604
00:38:19,520 --> 00:38:22,040
Please show compassion and help them.

605
00:38:22,120 --> 00:38:25,200
Your Ladyship,
don't be tempted by petty gains.

606
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:27,000
So many people
are offering their land and property

607
00:38:27,080 --> 00:38:28,520
in return for your protection.
Once you take them in,

608
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:30,560
you'll make enemies
of the great noble families.

609
00:38:30,640 --> 00:38:33,160
Beware. Tall trees catch the wind.
You could provoke their wrath.

610
00:38:33,240 --> 00:38:34,800
Such cowardice.

611
00:38:34,880 --> 00:38:37,240
Your Ladyship, your maternal grandmother

612
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:39,760
is the wet nurse
His Majesty respects most.

613
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:40,920
Your mother is his favored consort,

614
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:44,160
and your own brother is the Fourth Prince.

615
00:38:44,240 --> 00:38:45,640
You have the power to
stand against the nobles.

616
00:38:45,720 --> 00:38:48,120
What do their deaths
have to do with Her Ladyship?

617
00:38:49,240 --> 00:38:52,680
Liu Ziyang, you're afraid
they'll be forced to starve to death.

618
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:54,600
But have you spared
a thought for Her Ladyship?

619
00:38:54,680 --> 00:38:56,280
Her Ladyship has
treated you with such respect.

620
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:57,280
Why offer advice that will harm her?

621
00:38:58,160 --> 00:38:59,960
You've left
the Duke's Residence, Your Ladyship.

622
00:39:00,840 --> 00:39:03,000
If you turn these people away as well,

623
00:39:03,080 --> 00:39:05,400
you'll be telling everyone
you lack the power to protect them.

624
00:39:06,320 --> 00:39:08,160
You own vast stretches of fertile land.

625
00:39:08,240 --> 00:39:10,560
Everyone wants a piece of it.

626
00:39:11,200 --> 00:39:12,880
When the noble families

627
00:39:13,600 --> 00:39:15,120
close in on you like wolves and tigers,

628
00:39:15,720 --> 00:39:17,440
even if you give up
your land and property,

629
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:19,520
you may not be able to save yourself.

630
00:39:19,600 --> 00:39:21,920
Liu Ziyang, hold your tongue!

631
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:29,960
Open the gates!

632
00:39:32,600 --> 00:39:35,280
On behalf of the people,
I thank Your Ladyship for your kindness.

633
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:37,360
Your Ladyship, you mustn't!

634
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:39,440
You'll offend all the nobles.

635
00:39:39,520 --> 00:39:40,920
Disaster is sure to follow!

636
00:39:41,520 --> 00:39:42,640
Mr. Liu,

637
00:39:43,680 --> 00:39:46,920
you grew up in poverty,
so you understand the people's hardships.

638
00:39:47,600 --> 00:39:50,480
But you accept my pay,
so you owe me your loyalty.

639
00:39:52,120 --> 00:39:54,640
An adviser
who pushes their master into danger

640
00:39:54,720 --> 00:39:56,080
deserves to die a hundred times over.

641
00:39:57,480 --> 00:40:00,080
Do it again,
and I'll throw you out of the estate.

642
00:40:02,400 --> 00:40:04,320
Everyone who comes to me for refuge

643
00:40:05,160 --> 00:40:06,120
is entitled to my protection.

644
00:40:07,440 --> 00:40:10,560
Go. Register the people
offering their land.

645
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:12,840
Yes.

646
00:40:13,960 --> 00:40:16,360
Open the gates! Open them now!

647
00:40:16,440 --> 00:40:17,640
Your Ladyship!

648
00:40:17,720 --> 00:40:18,920
<i>Listen carefully.</i>

649
00:40:19,520 --> 00:40:21,040
<i>Set up a complaint box outside the gates.</i>

650
00:40:21,640 --> 00:40:23,480
<i>Anyone whose land's been seized</i>
<i>or who's been abused by the nobles…</i>

651
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:24,680
- Please step back, everyone!
<i>- Can put a written complaint in the box…</i>

652
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,600
Line up, everyone!

653
00:40:25,680 --> 00:40:27,200
<i>I'll remove the names of the complainants.</i>

654
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:30,160
- One at a time.
<i>- Only take in those who farm state land.</i>

655
00:40:30,240 --> 00:40:32,560
- Register everyone.
<i>- Don't accept a mu of private land.</i>

656
00:40:33,160 --> 00:40:34,240
People love to accuse

657
00:40:34,320 --> 00:40:36,440
my maternal grandmother and
mother of exploiting their imperial ties.

658
00:40:36,520 --> 00:40:38,440
We might as well earn that reputation.

659
00:40:38,520 --> 00:40:40,280
If anyone comes seeking revenge,

660
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:43,160
I'll present proof of
his crimes to His Majesty.

661
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:46,280
Seizing state land is a capital crime.

662
00:40:47,160 --> 00:40:48,720
Life is only a few decades long.

663
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:50,640
- Line up!
- Every extra day is a bonus.

664
00:40:50,720 --> 00:40:53,480
- I might as well live boldly and fiercely.
- Next.

665
00:40:54,160 --> 00:40:55,240
Let's see

666
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:58,680
who dares cross me first.

667
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:09,320
Understood.

668
00:41:09,400 --> 00:41:11,840
Make way!

669
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,280
My niece!

670
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:16,120
My dear niece, Your Ladyship!

671
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:19,560
What brings you here, Uncle Jiu?

672
00:41:19,640 --> 00:41:21,840
Your grandmother is gravely ill.
I've come to fetch you myself.

673
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,200
Grandmother is gravely ill?

674
00:41:24,080 --> 00:41:25,040
Gejin, prepare the carriage.

675
00:41:25,120 --> 00:41:26,160
Yes.

676
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:29,760
I'd heard of
Zhuyu Estate's wealth and splendor.

677
00:41:29,840 --> 00:41:31,200
I thought people were just exaggerating.

678
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:33,680
But now I see
there's far more to it than that!

679
00:41:33,760 --> 00:41:36,680
The estate is vast,
but your influence is even greater!

680
00:41:37,480 --> 00:41:39,760
Lady Li still enjoys His Majesty's favor.

681
00:41:39,840 --> 00:41:42,800
His affection for her
has clearly extended to you.

682
00:41:42,880 --> 00:41:45,200
Gentlemen, I'll leave this in your hands.

683
00:41:45,280 --> 00:41:47,080
- One at a time!
- Let's go, Uncle Jiu.

684
00:41:47,680 --> 00:41:49,920
We're leaving already?
Won't you show me around?

685
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:53,200
- I know you're worried.
- Next!

686
00:41:53,280 --> 00:41:55,280
I'll visit another day. Let's go.

687
00:41:55,360 --> 00:41:56,400
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!

688
00:41:56,480 --> 00:41:57,400
Incredible!

689
00:41:57,480 --> 00:41:59,480
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!

690
00:41:59,560 --> 00:42:01,000
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

691
00:42:19,400 --> 00:42:20,880
Wei Jin,

692
00:42:21,680 --> 00:42:23,720
is that you?

693
00:42:24,440 --> 00:42:26,440
Grandmother, it's me.

694
00:42:27,240 --> 00:42:28,120
I've come home.

695
00:42:28,200 --> 00:42:31,040
Dowager Lady, it's not Lord Wei Jin.

696
00:42:31,120 --> 00:42:33,640
Lady Rao has come
back especially to see you.

697
00:42:34,560 --> 00:42:35,880
Rao.

698
00:42:37,480 --> 00:42:38,320
No.

699
00:42:39,840 --> 00:42:41,600
I don't want to see her.

700
00:42:42,200 --> 00:42:45,160
I'm too ashamed to face her.

701
00:42:45,240 --> 00:42:46,960
I don't want to see her.

702
00:42:47,960 --> 00:42:50,880
It's only been a few days.
How did Grandmother become so ill?

703
00:42:54,160 --> 00:42:56,200
WEI SHU, PRINCESS CONSORT DUAN

704
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:59,240
Grandmother fell ill after
returning from Xianzhuang.

705
00:43:00,880 --> 00:43:04,080
Overnight, her hair turned white.

706
00:43:06,600 --> 00:43:09,240
Rao, I'm your eldest cousin.

707
00:43:11,840 --> 00:43:12,800
Greetings, Princess Consort Duan.

708
00:43:14,280 --> 00:43:16,000
Rao,

709
00:43:17,720 --> 00:43:20,440
I've wronged you.

710
00:43:22,200 --> 00:43:26,120
I kept saying I'd protect you.

711
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:29,120
But the truth is,

712
00:43:29,920 --> 00:43:32,200
I still harbored resentment

713
00:43:33,920 --> 00:43:37,120
toward your mother.

714
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:40,000
I was selfish.

715
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:42,760
I was foolish.

716
00:43:43,760 --> 00:43:45,440
Rao,

717
00:43:46,400 --> 00:43:49,160
I've wronged you

718
00:43:49,920 --> 00:43:54,040
and my son who died so young.

719
00:43:54,120 --> 00:43:55,320
My son…

720
00:43:56,840 --> 00:43:57,680
Grandmother,

721
00:43:58,920 --> 00:44:00,920
thank you for telling me the truth.

722
00:44:02,120 --> 00:44:03,000
I don't blame you.

723
00:44:06,040 --> 00:44:09,480
Don't stop me! Wei Rao!
You owe me my mother's life!

724
00:44:09,560 --> 00:44:12,560
Chan, don't be rude to Her Ladyship! Chan!

725
00:44:14,840 --> 00:44:16,000
Wei Chan,

726
00:44:17,040 --> 00:44:20,040
your mother switched the babies
and poisoned Jundai.

727
00:44:20,120 --> 00:44:22,360
She killed herself to escape punishment.

728
00:44:22,440 --> 00:44:23,480
No one else is to blame.

729
00:44:23,560 --> 00:44:24,440
Nonsense!

730
00:44:25,040 --> 00:44:26,880
Lady Li forced her to kill herself.

731
00:44:26,960 --> 00:44:29,200
You and your mother are both murderers!

732
00:44:29,280 --> 00:44:31,600
- Chan, hold your tongue!
- Shu,

733
00:44:32,120 --> 00:44:33,960
she caused our mother's death.

734
00:44:34,040 --> 00:44:35,240
How can you take an outsider's side?

735
00:44:35,320 --> 00:44:39,040
Father told me everything that happened.

736
00:44:40,560 --> 00:44:43,160
Mother's wrongdoing left Her Ladyship
to fend for herself as a commoner.

737
00:44:44,040 --> 00:44:46,520
Lady Li and Noble Lady Wu'an
have held no one else accountable.

738
00:44:46,600 --> 00:44:47,680
That alone is a great act of mercy.

739
00:44:48,520 --> 00:44:51,560
What right do you have
to blame the victim?

740
00:44:55,560 --> 00:44:57,600
She was the mother who gave birth to us.

741
00:44:58,200 --> 00:45:00,360
Are you putting
justice above your own family

742
00:45:00,440 --> 00:45:02,160
just to make yourself look virtuous?

743
00:45:02,240 --> 00:45:03,800
Mother was in the wrong!

744
00:45:04,480 --> 00:45:07,680
I've taught you since you were little
to have a conscience

745
00:45:07,760 --> 00:45:09,400
and know where to draw the line.

746
00:45:09,480 --> 00:45:11,960
You must learn to tell right from wrong.

747
00:45:13,160 --> 00:45:15,520
Governess Wang, take her back to her room

748
00:45:15,600 --> 00:45:16,800
and keep her confined!

749
00:45:16,880 --> 00:45:18,280
Yes.

750
00:45:18,360 --> 00:45:20,320
- You're always so heartless.
- Take Lady Chan away.

751
00:45:20,400 --> 00:45:23,040
Are you still our mother's daughter?
Are you still my sister?

752
00:45:23,120 --> 00:45:25,040
- Are you? Answer me!
- Lady Chan.

753
00:45:25,120 --> 00:45:26,280
- Lady Chan.
- Let go of me!

754
00:45:27,120 --> 00:45:28,400
Let go!

755
00:45:31,640 --> 00:45:33,280
Chan is still reeling from Mother's death,

756
00:45:33,880 --> 00:45:35,440
so she's struggling to stay composed.

757
00:45:35,520 --> 00:45:36,840
Please forgive her behavior.

758
00:45:37,640 --> 00:45:39,600
You're Uncle Jin's daughter

759
00:45:40,120 --> 00:45:41,280
and my younger cousin.

760
00:45:41,960 --> 00:45:43,600
For the wrongs my mother committed,

761
00:45:44,160 --> 00:45:45,920
I'll make amends in the years to come.

762
00:45:46,680 --> 00:45:48,520
You are truly noble-minded, Your Highness.

763
00:45:49,160 --> 00:45:50,240
I truly admire you.

764
00:45:50,840 --> 00:45:54,080
I thought you would hate me.

765
00:45:55,480 --> 00:45:58,720
Mother's death has saddened me too.

766
00:45:59,760 --> 00:46:01,560
But I've had an education.

767
00:46:01,640 --> 00:46:04,720
I understand what truly matters,
and I know right from wrong.

768
00:46:05,280 --> 00:46:06,440
It was a feud among our elders,

769
00:46:06,520 --> 00:46:08,600
yet you were innocently caught up in it.

770
00:46:09,240 --> 00:46:10,480
How could I bear to blame you too?

771
00:46:15,080 --> 00:46:16,880
I believe sincerity
earns sincerity in return.

772
00:46:18,040 --> 00:46:19,120
I hope that one day,

773
00:46:19,880 --> 00:46:21,240
you'll truly see me as family

774
00:46:21,760 --> 00:46:23,000
and call me Shu.

775
00:46:25,120 --> 00:46:26,840
Only you and I are left to
uphold the Wei family's standing.

776
00:46:27,440 --> 00:46:31,680
We must put our grievances
behind us and work together.

777
00:46:52,280 --> 00:46:54,800
Chan, please eat a little…

778
00:46:57,240 --> 00:46:59,840
Go pretend to be her loving cousin!
Why bother coming to see me?

779
00:47:00,440 --> 00:47:03,600
For the sake of an outsider,
you won't even avenge our mother!

780
00:47:11,080 --> 00:47:12,240
Chan,

781
00:47:13,240 --> 00:47:16,000
Father has achieved little in his career,

782
00:47:16,080 --> 00:47:18,040
and Grandmother is old and frail.

783
00:47:18,120 --> 00:47:20,280
Our household has no capable successor.

784
00:47:20,880 --> 00:47:24,760
Why do you think
I was able to marry Prince Duan?

785
00:47:26,680 --> 00:47:29,720
Because Uncle Jin
gave his life for the country,

786
00:47:30,720 --> 00:47:32,480
and His Majesty took
our uncle's widow as a consort.

787
00:47:33,680 --> 00:47:36,920
His Majesty felt indebted to our family.

788
00:47:37,440 --> 00:47:39,320
He married me to
a prince as his principal wife,

789
00:47:39,920 --> 00:47:41,160
partly to make amends

790
00:47:42,600 --> 00:47:44,520
and partly to ensure
our family be good to Wei Rao.

791
00:47:45,520 --> 00:47:46,960
If Wei Rao hadn't been too young then,

792
00:47:47,560 --> 00:47:49,480
I would never be Princess Consort Duan.

793
00:47:50,080 --> 00:47:51,720
Mother benefited from the generosity,

794
00:47:51,800 --> 00:47:54,040
then repaid it by tearing
Lady Li and her daughter apart.

795
00:47:54,560 --> 00:47:56,240
It was an unforgivable wrong.

796
00:47:56,960 --> 00:47:57,960
ORCHID GRACE ROOM

797
00:47:58,040 --> 00:48:00,920
But Shu, I can't move on from this!

798
00:48:01,000 --> 00:48:02,520
I can't let go of this hatred!

799
00:48:02,600 --> 00:48:04,120
- Chan…
- I can't!

800
00:48:04,200 --> 00:48:05,320
Chan!

801
00:48:06,080 --> 00:48:08,200
Do you remember what I told you?

802
00:48:09,880 --> 00:48:11,680
You must know what truly matters

803
00:48:11,760 --> 00:48:13,680
and consider
the bigger picture in everything.

804
00:48:14,200 --> 00:48:16,240
Live with integrity
and treat others kindly.

805
00:48:17,080 --> 00:48:20,880
Swallow all the bitterness and resentment
you carry in your heart.

806
00:48:21,840 --> 00:48:24,360
Be a good cousin to Noble Lady Wu'an.

807
00:48:25,160 --> 00:48:26,320
Okay?

808
00:48:28,680 --> 00:48:29,800
In life,…

809
00:48:33,480 --> 00:48:35,120
one must let go of something…

810
00:48:37,880 --> 00:48:39,880
to receive something in return.

811
00:51:05,560 --> 00:51:08,200
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
